  "_about": "Where the standing paper pieces of Gặp áo go, on the lying book. Units are px on a page 570 wide x 700 deep (the left page). x = left edge of the piece, or r = right edge measured from the right side of the page (use one of the two); y = the glue line, measured from the far edge of the page (0 = far, 700 = near you); h = height of the piece when it stands up; w = width (omit it to keep the picture's own ratio); lift = the picture floats this many px above its glue line on a thin kraft strut. level = the collage level that shows the piece (1 always, 2 medium = the default, 3 when the mix boost is on). d = delay in seconds before it rises. The base layers use the roles in SCENES (mid/wings/prop side).",
